# Environment variable template for the Agentic SDLC Framework.
#
# This file is intentionally empty of variables.
# Document every future environment variable here, with a description and a
# placeholder value (never a real credential), as it is introduced.
#
# Usage: copy to `.env` locally. `.env` is git-ignored and must never be committed.
#
# Expected categories (to be added when needed):
#   - Issue tracker integration settings (e.g. Jira site URL)
#   - Source control / PR settings
#   - Application runtime configuration for the generated project
